        "id": "IN4",
        "study_id": "S1",
        "part_id": null,
        "statement": "Content that caregivers judged missing, such as sleep and communication, is present in the 25-item EQ-HWB, suggesting item reduction removed content relevant to this population, although the measure is intentionally generic.",
